```
const dataHome = process.env.OPENCODE_DATA_HOME?.trim() || join(process.env.UB_DATA_DIR?.trim() || tmpdir(), "opencode-xdg-data");
```
On Render UB_DATA_DIR is /var/data/unfinished-business; so defaults to /var/data/unfinished-business/opencode-xdg-data, good. Removes hardcode.
But for local? render-start not used locally. Fine.
Also configHome.

