```
openCode.once("error", err => {
 const diagnostic = openCodeStartDiagnostic(err);
 log.error("opencode_start_failed", { code: diagnostic.code, message: diagnostic.message });
 stop(1);
});
```
Exit code logs as before. Maybe title. Use no raw path.

