child.stdout.on("data", ... cap 8KB); stderr...
poll fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${port}/api/info`) every 250ms up to 30s. Need read response maybe version. If exits early -> fail with diagnostic.
finally kill SIGTERM, wait 5s then SIGKILL? Use await events once.
print {status PASS, platform, serverVersion, port? no need}
process.exitCode.
