content.text:
At 768, media max 960 hides site nav etc, but header still flex no wrap; brand name wraps. We can improve at <=960: hide `.brand-tag`, maybe `.header-model-inline` at <=960 instead of 720, allow `brand-name` no-wrap. Or add compact header for 768. Screenshot brand "Unfinished Business" wraps because container width is constrained by actions. Add CSS at max-width 960:
```
.brand-name { white-space: nowrap; }
.header-model-inline { display:none; }
.workshop-header-actions a { display:none; } maybe at 960 to free space.
```
